# Required signal output skeleton (fill with cycle-specific values).

EMIT sections IN ORDER:
  1. DISRUPTION WATCH (if disruption_scout_rules loaded)
  2. TIER 1 MACRO: clarity X/10, factors, bias, conviction
  3. TIER 2 4H: trend, MAs, RSI, levels, confirms_macro [YES/NO/MIXED]
  4. TIER 3 1H: trend, MAs, RSI, confirms [YES/NO/MIXED]
  5. TIER 4 15M: pattern, RSI, execution_chart [YES/NO + why]
  6. TIER 5 5M: setup, volume, improves_15M [YES/NO + why]
  7. DECISION: SIGNAL, confluence, execution_chart, aggression + reasoning
  8. IF LONG/SHORT: entry, stop, T1, T2, risk_plan, sizing, verified T1 profit
  9. IF NO-TRADE: reason, what_would_change_mind, next_check
 10. LAST LINE EXACT: GOLD_SIGNAL=[LONG/SHORT/NEUTRAL]

IF CLOSURE_RISK gate triggered THEN include CLOSURE RISK line before DECISION block
